      "id": "sol.amc-10b-2014-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned} \\dfrac{2^3 + 2^3}{2^{-3} + 2^{-3}} &= \\dfrac{2\\cdot 2^3}{2\\cdot 2^{-3}} \\\\&=2^6 \\\\&= 64 \\end{aligned}\\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is E .",
